# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (mode=production). Committed on purpose.
#
# Without this, a production build with no VITE_API_BASE in its environment
# falls back to <this host>:8080 — the static site's own domain, on a port
# nothing listens on. That is not a useful default for a deployed build, and
# the resulting ERR_SSL_PROTOCOL_ERROR does not hint at its own cause.
#
# A real environment variable takes precedence over this file, so setting
# VITE_API_BASE on the build environment (Render service, CI) still wins and
# nothing has to change here to deploy elsewhere.
#
# Public URL of a public demo, so there is nothing secret to leak. Point it
# somewhere else — or override it — if you run your own backend.
VITE_API_BASE=https://springbootcrmbackend.onrender.com
